 <h3><u>Zehra ko do pursa</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Zehra ko do pursa</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Karbobala Ke Dasht Mai, Be Aasra Aale Nabi</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Maare Gaye Ansar Sab, Zakhmi Huwa Ibne Ali</p> <p>Munis Nahi Yawar Nahi, Ghazi Nahi Akber Nahi</p> <p>Bikhde Pade Hai Jaa Bajaa, Laashe Kahin Aur Sar Kahin</p> <p>Matam Karo Ehle Aza, Ghar Lutgaya Shabbir Ka</p> <p>Purse Ko Aayi Sayyeda, Matam Karo Ehle Aza</p> <p>Pursa Bhare Ghar Ka Hai Yeh, Jo Karbala Mai Lutgaya</p> <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
    <p>Ik Do pahar Mei Lutgaya, Makhdum-e-Alam Ka Ghar</p>
    <p>Kaunain Ki Shahzadiyan, Nauha Kuna Hai Nange Sar</p>
    <p>Tumse Ali Ki Laadli Kehti Hai Yeh Sar Pit Kar</p>
    <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
    <p>Ai Rone Waalo Kya Kahe, Kaisi Huwi Ham Par Jafaa</p>
    <p>Kohe-Musibbat Ghir Paraa, Ham Hogaye Be Aasra</p>
    <p>Har Majlise Shabbir Mai, Aati Hai Zainab Ki Sadaa</p>
    <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
    <p>Paamaal Hai Farwaa Ka Dil, Paamaal Qasim Ka Badan</p>
    <p>Mara Gaya Nawshaah Bhi, Pardes Mai Tashna Dahan</p>
    <p>Shaale Azaa Pehne Huwe, Kehti Hai Ik Shab Ki Dulhan</p>
    <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
    <p>Nana Ki Jo Taswir Tha, Rukhsat Huwa Khaakar Sinaa(n)</p>
    <p>Ik Haath Sine Par Rakhe, Behosh Hai Akber Ki Maa(n)</p>
    <p>Zindaa Rahun Kaise Bhalaa, Hai Umme Laila Ki Fughaa(n)</p>
    <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
    <p>Kya Asr ka Hungaam Tha, Jab Shaah Par Khanjar Chalaa</p>
    <p>Woh Teraa Zarbe Shimr Ki, Mazlum Ka Sukha Galaa</p>
    <p>Maadar Ko Dekha Dasht Mai, Aur Zere-Lab Kehne Laga</p>
    <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
    <p>Shame-Ghariba Aagayi, Karbobala Roti Rahi</p>
    <p>Jalti Huwi Uss Khaak Par, Baithi Rahi Aale Nabi</p>
    <p>Dashte Balaa Mai Marsiya. Karti Rahi Binte Ali</p>
    <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p>
    <li>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</li>
   </ol> <p>Hai Mazhar-o-Irfan Bhi, Farshe Aza Par Maatami</p> <p>Aankhon Se Jaari Alqama, Purse Ka Hai Haq Toh Yehi</p> <p>Marham Dil-e-Zehra Ka hai, Nauhagari Sinazani</p> <p>(Sab Milke Azadaro, Zehra Ko Do Pursa) x2</p> <p>Barbaad Huwa Ran Mai, Ghar Aale Payambar Ka</p></font>
